{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The driver's own platform record trips the anti-farming guard in POL-NS-07. EV-DPROF-00207 records driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d of 7, which is 4 or more, and 7 against driver_profile.completed_trips_30d of 61 works out at 11.5 percent, which is above the 0.08 rate limb. Both limbs of the check are met on this trip's evidence, so this is the second limb of POL-NS-07 engaging, not a borderline call.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Because both limbs of the anti-farming check are met, POL-NS-07 withholds the driver's compensation and routes the case to escalation under POL-NS-09, and it obliges the escalation packet to direct the reviewer to refund the rider's cancellation fee in full, precisely so that the rider does not fund a dispute the platform has not resolved. EV-FARE-00207 shows the $4.00 sitting at PENDING with refund_issued_sgd 0.00, so nothing has been taken from the rider and the packet instruction is that the $4.00 be returned.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00207", "EV-FARE-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07", "POL-NS-09"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Escalation is the correct disposition and is terminal for the automated pipeline: under POL-NS-09 no monetary ruling issues and the disputed cancellation fee is placed on hold rather than collected or refunded, and under POL-GEN-03 ESCALATE is party-relative - the disputed amount is held. On a rider-filed dispute over a fee still at PENDING, that is the outcome the rider presses for, because the $4.00 stays uncollected while the platform's own integrity question on this driver is open.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-09", "POL-GEN-03"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The escalation trigger is not built on degraded material. EV-DPROF-00207 is COMPLETE with an empty issues list and weight_multiplier 1.0, so there is no POL-GEN-02 discount to apply to the no-show-termination and completed-trip counters, and the escalation rests on a clean artifact rather than on an impairment of the rider's choosing.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-02"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's relief here does not run through POL-NS-06, and I do not stretch it to say otherwise: the driver's own telemetry shows a single continuous qualifying in-geofence run of 507 seconds, 06:41:10 to 06:49:37, against the 300 second STANDARD minimum, so there is no waiting-period shortfall. The route to the rider not carrying this charge is the POL-NS-07 anti-farming escalation, not a dwell finding.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Nor does the rider's case run through POL-NS-04, and I do not pretend it does. EV-CHAT-00207 holds four entries and every one is sent by the SYSTEM or the driver; the rider wrote nothing during the waiting window, so limb (a) of the rider-contact clause - a locating or coordinating message from the rider - is not met, and the rider cannot invoke that exoneration on this record.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00207"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

{
  "ruling": {
    "ruling": "ESCALATE",
    "amount_sgd": null,
    "driver_compensation_sgd": null,
    "referrals": [
      "POL-NS-07: the anti-farming check has tripped (7 no-show terminations in 30 days against 61 completed trips, 11.5%) — direct the human reviewer to refund the rider's cancellation fee of SGD 4.00 in full; the fee stays held pending review."
    ],
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "explanation": "To both of you: this case is going to a human reviewer, so no money moves yet. The $4.00 is held as it presently is — not collected from the rider and not paid out — and this is not a finding on the fee itself.\n\nDriver — your no-show charge is made out on the merits. You marked 'arrived' at 06:41:20, and the GPS trace puts you inside the 50 m STANDARD pickup geofence from 06:41:10, holding position continuously for 507 seconds before you cancelled at 06:49:37 with reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW. That is more than the 300-second STANDARD minimum, so all four limbs of POL-NS-01 are met; the arrival test in POL-NS-02 is also satisfied on 52 consecutive qualifying in-radius fixes. None of the rider-side exit routes opens: you were inside the radius, so POL-NS-03 (wrong entrance) does not apply; your arrival marker landed on a qualifying in-geofence fix only 10 seconds after the dwell began, so POL-NS-05 (false arrival) does not apply; and your 507-second dwell had no shortfall, so POL-NS-06 does not apply.\n\nRider — your account that you 'did come down' is not supported. The rider track in the GPS trace places your device a mean 1,900 m from the pin for the whole window, with zero qualifying fixes inside the 100 m STANDARD presence radius, and the chat log contains no message sent by you at all. Limb (a) and limb (c) of POL-NS-04 both fail, so that clause cannot exonerate you. The cancelled call the driver placed at 06:45:10 reinforces the point rather than helping you.\n\nWhy the case escalates instead of simply paying the driver: POL-NS-07 would normally pay the driver 80% of the fee ($3.20), but only if an anti-farming check is passed. On the driver's own profile there were 7 no-show terminations in the last 30 days out of 61 completed trips — 11.5%, above the 8% rate limb — so both limbs of that check trip. Compensation is therefore withheld and the case routes to escalation under POL-NS-09, whose trigger (d) is engaged. Escalation under POL-NS-09 is terminal: no monetary ruling issues and the disputed fee is placed on hold rather than collected or refunded. The escalation does not rest on degraded material — the driver profile artifact is COMPLETE at weight 1.0, so no POL-GEN-02 discount applies. The traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00207-01 is MISSING, weight 0.0, and carries no fact; no limb turns on it, so its absence changes nothing here. The escalation packet carries the POL-NS-07 instruction into the referral below. The open question for the reviewer is the one the clause raises: whether the driver's recent no-show pattern reflects fee-farming, and if so the rider's fee is to be returned in full."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}
